        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n        2 Afalume 22:1—23:30; 2 Nyakati 34:1—35:27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati wa mfalume Josiya, Mwenyezi Mlungu waniamba, “Dze ukaona go arigohenda ye Iziraeli asiye muaminifu? Iye wazinga kpwenye chila chidzango chire na tsini ya chila muhi mkpwulu? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mino náona kukala bada ya kuhenda mambo gaga andaniuyira, ela kayaniuyira bii, na Juda, mwanao mchetu mwenye handzo achiviona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mimi námupha Iziraeli, mchetu asiye muaminifu, talaka ya kuonyesa kukala hukarichana kpwa sababu ya kusakala muaminifu. Ela Juda, mwanáo mchetu mwenye handzo kayaogofyerwa, iye naye watuluka achendahenda udiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa kukala uzembe kpwakpwe kala ni dzambo ra kawaida, waihenda tsi ikale najisi kpwa kuvoya vizuka vya mawe na mihi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bada ya gaga gosi, Juda, nduguye mchetu mwenye handzo kayaniuyira moyo kutsuka, ela wahenda dzihenda tu, mimi Mwenyezi Mlungu nkaamba.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Mwenyezi Mlungu achiniamba, “Ye Iziraeli asiye muaminifu chisha ana baha kuriko Juda, mwenye handzo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phiya uphande wa vurini ukatangaze uambe,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Nami ndakuphani arisa anifwahirao mwangu moyoni, ambao andakufundzani marifwa na kumanya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na wakati ndiphokala mkavyalana na kuenjerezeka kpwenye yo tsi, atu taandahadza tsona Sanduku ra chilagane ra Mwenyezi Mlungu. Taandaritambukira tsona, taandariaza wala kutengeza ranjina, mimi Mwenyezi Mlungu nkaamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati uho Jerusalemu indaihwa chihi cha endzi cha Mwenyezi Mlungu, na atu osi a mataifa andakusanyika mumo Jerusalemu ili kuishimu dzina ra Mwenyezi Mlungu, nao taandailunga tsona mioyo yao mii na mifu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati uho atu a Juda andagbwirana na atu a Iziraeli, nao andakpwedza phamwenga kula tsi za uphande wa vurini, edze kpwenye tsi nriyoapha akare enu arisi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ela hangu hu adide hendo hiri ra waibu rikaangamiza ana ehu alume na achetu phamwenga na chila chitu ambacho chaphahikana kpwa jasho ra akare ehu: vyaa vya mangʼondzi, mbuzi na ngʼombe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nahulale photsi kpwa waibu hurio nao na waibu wehu ukale wazi, mana hukamuhendera dambi Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wehu, swiswi na baba zehu hangu hu adide hadi rero. Tahuyaishimu sauti ya Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wehu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.3.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
